-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. The monthly cost of a yearly plan is its price divided by 12. The monthly cost of a weekly plan is its price × 52 ÷ 12. All monthly costs are rounded to the nearest cent.
 
